  m_text: 'NOTE:


    This is a bug fixes version prior to version 1.1,

    the
    one submitted to the jam. There are still some

    bugs (eg. water breaking)
    but the game is completable.


    There''s a new option to revert this update,
    but it''s highly

    recommended to play with this disabled. It''s also

    recommended
    to play on Windows rather than Web.


    If you get stuck at some point, remember
    you can watch the

    Playthrough video linked at the itch.io page of this game.'
